@@ -1300,3 +1300,12 @@ The ``GET /servers/{server_id}``, ``GET /servers/detail``
 ``PUT /servers/{server_id}`` and ``POST /server/{server_id}/action``
 (rebuild) responses now include the scheduler hints provided during
 server creation.
+
+2.106 (private fork extension)
+------------------------------
+
+Adds project-scoped instance checkpoint capabilities, create, list, show,
+revert, delete and operation status. New creates require an explicit live
+executor capability and artifact budget. This N1 contract does not implement
+physical RAM or storage operations; the default driver reports unsupported.
+The private extension is not an upstream compatibility claim.
